<div class="container mt-5 mb-5">
  <div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-md-8">
      <div class="card card-custom p-5">
        <h2 class="fw-bold mb-4">Privacy Policy</h2>
        
        <h5>1. Introduction</h5>
        <p class="text-muted small">At HealthID, your privacy and data security are our highest priority. This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use, and protect your sensitive medical information.</p>

        <h5>2. Information We Collect</h5>
        <p class="text-muted small">We collect personal details (name, blood group, date of birth) and medical data (allergies, emergency contacts, medical reports) that you voluntarily upload to create your Emergency Profile.</p>

        <h5>3. How We Use Your Data</h5>
        <p class="text-muted small">Your data is strictly used to generate your Emergency QR Code and power the AI Allergy Engine. We do not sell or share your personal health information with third-party advertisers.</p>

        <h5>4. Data Security (HIPAA & GDPR)</h5>
        <p class="text-muted small">All data is encrypted in transit and at rest. While HealthID is a demonstration platform, we employ industry-standard security practices. By generating a public Emergency QR code, you explicitly consent to sharing that specific medical profile with anyone who scans the code in an emergency.</p>

        <h5>5. Your Rights</h5>
        <p class="text-muted small">You have the right to delete your account and all associated medical data at any time from your Dashboard settings. Upon deletion, your data is permanently removed from our servers.</p>

        <hr class="my-4">
        
        <p class="text-center mb-0">
          <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary-custom">Return to Home</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

